O7r8NSWAxWroq8BHdbTD7AQ3IcHCKkBKAc",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一直以來吃麵就喜歡加辣，這間店的辛味豚骨拉麵辣的很剛好，不會蓋掉湯頭本身的濃郁美味，麵很Q彈，肉片的嚼勁也剛剛好，還有我也愛那筍子。\n小菜的豬排和豆腐雖然我拍起來還好，但味道口感都非常棒！ 豬排很脆口感扎實，雖沒到juicy，但整體仍是瑕不掩瑜；然後豆腐味道真的很讚，酥脆的外皮，搭配柴魚醬的鮮甜，吃到後來冷掉了，還是一樣好吃（那個醬我很喜歡）！",null,[0,173]]]],[null,1663816831000000,1663816831000000,"3 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQUFWSkZDUUkwa1ZrY1A2eUFBODhJQQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfQUFWSkZDUUkwa1ZrY1A2eUFBODhJQRoSQ2dzSV82aXZtUVlRNEszWVpR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjJtO7r8NSWAxWroq8BHdbTD7AQ_2MIqwEoCA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/14018019527169066836/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXliSE50WW1GbkVBRRAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的圖文並茂..謝謝支持",null,[0,14]]]],[null,null,11462,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQybHNtYmFnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x6247a1ea92aed6f8!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID2lsmbag%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQybHNtYmFnEAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQybHNtYmFnEi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRDJs